    "detailed_description": "<h1>Update Notes</h1><p><strong>New</strong>:<br>The version with the virtual reality and A-Frame / WebVR is available (in test mode).<br>- Launch SteamVR.<br>- Use a default compatible web browser (.<br>- Enable WebVR if necessary (with Chrome for example).<br>- Choose an &quot;Audio Mode&quot; to enable or disable a 3D positional audio track.<br>- Choose the &quot;Game Mode&quot; to play and kill the monsters by avoiding to miss them.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Free the Animation</strong><br><br>WebGL Animation and Game<br><br>Animation with the Roller Coaster<br>Shooting Game with the Roller Coaster<br><br>Many Background Images:<br>- Cubemaps<br>- Spherical Panoramas<br>- Planar Panoramas<br><br>Many Dynamic Effects:<br>- Fog Density<br>- Exposure of the Cubemaps and of the Panoramas<br>- Color Mixing with Variable Opacity<br><br>Notes:<br>- Compatibility with 4K / HDR<br>- SBS (Side-by-Side)<br>- Full Screen<br>- Gamepad Support<br>- 3D Positional Audio",
